# The raw Q tables are NOT committed, following the M7/M8/Q1 convention: no raw
# measurement data is versioned, and every verifier recomputes from frozen seeds
# instead (see experiments/m7/verify_G15.js, experiments/q1/data).
#
# What IS committed is sufficient to reproduce and validate them exactly:
#   candidates.jsonl          every one of the 4000 candidates with its disposition
#   INTEGRITY.sha256          digests of the artifacts + the regeneration command
#   ../results/uqa_results.json  the frozen-protocol outcome, with a per-arm
#                             fingerprint and a per-arm load-hook attestation for
#                             every configuration
#
# Regenerate with:  cd experiments/uqa && node run_collection.js
qtables.jsonl
